    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Warhorse Armor\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"1\"> <span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Variant: Warhorse Armor</span><span class=\"ve-flex-vh-center\"><span class=\"rd__h-toggle ml-2 clickable no-select no-print lst-is-exporting-image__hidden\" data-rd-h-special-toggle-button=\"true\" title=\"Toggle Visibility (CTRL to Toggle All)\">[–]</span></span></h4> <p>An armored warhorse has an AC based on the type of barding worn (see the Player's Handbook for more information on barding). The horse's AC includes its Dexterity modifier, where applicable. Barding doesn't alter the horse's challenge rating.</p><table class=\"w-100 rd__table  stripe-odd-table\"><thead><tr><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \" data-rd-isroller=\"false\">AC</th><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \" data-rd-isroller=\"false\">Barding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">12</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"leather%20barding_phb\">Leather</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">13</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"studded%20leather%20barding_phb\">Studded leather</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">14</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"ring%20mail%20barding_phb\">Ring mail</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">15</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"scale%20mail%20barding_phb\">Scale mail</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">16</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"chain%20mail%20barding_phb\">Chain mail</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">17</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"splint%20barding_phb\">Splint</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \">18</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-6 ve-text-center \"><span class=\"bold\" data-vet-page=\"items.html\" data-vet-source=\"phb\" data-vet-hash=\"plate%20barding_phb\">Plate</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
